        78.81909942626953,
        69.16120147705078,
        481.4836730957031,
        82.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "well-trained skilled staff are needed to administer and interpret this class of tests;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        84.66120147705078,
        78.81909942626953,
        97.80619812011719
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        84.66120147705078,
        526.964111328125,
        97.80619812011719
      ],
      "text": "multiuse vials will require effective operational planning and batching; hence, single-use",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        100.16120147705078,
        403.0666198730469,
        113.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "vials or vials with fewer doses to match daily needs are preferred;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.66120147705078,
        78.81909942626953,
        128.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        115.66120147705078,
        527.1845092773438,
        128.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "procurement and stock management aspects will have to be considered, as with",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        131.16119384765625,
        264.6339111328125,
        144.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "implementing any new class of tests;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        146.66119384765625,
        78.81909942626953,
        159.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        146.66119384765625,
        526.7446899414062,
        159.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "because the reading of the TBST results requires a second patient visit, linkage to care",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        162.16119384765625,
        346.54791259765625,
        175.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "requires reinforcement, to decrease loss to follow-up;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        177.66119384765625,
        78.81909942626953,
        190.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        177.66119384765625,
        527.2498168945312,
        190.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "global market availability and necessary volumes of the new class of tests must be considered;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        193.16119384765625,
        104.03639221191406,
        206.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        208.66119384765625,
        78.81909942626953,
        221.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        208.66119384765625,
        479.4825439453125,
        221.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "measurement of the TBST reaction size and interpretation must be standardized.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        237.0075225830078,
        246.56613159179688,
        253.3875274658203
      ],
      "text": "Monitoring and evaluation",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        262.138427734375,
        392.78692626953125,
        275.283447265625
      ],
      "text": "Factors that will require monitoring and evaluation are as follows:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        281.890380859375,
        78.81909942626953,
        295.035400390625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        281.890380859375,
        526.9619750976562,
        295.035400390625
      ],
      "text": "adverse event monitoring is a gap with the current TST use; thus, recording and reporting",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        297.390380859375,
        527.0081787109375,
        310.535400390625
      ],
      "text": "systems for results and adverse events need to be introduced when implementing the new",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        312.890380859375,
        132.18539428710938,
        326.035400390625
      ],
      "text": "tests; and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        328.3904113769531,
        78.81909942626953,
        341.5354309082031
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        328.3904113769531,
        526.8760986328125,
        341.5354309082031
      ],
      "text": "there is a need to monitor the linkage between results of the new class of the tests and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        343.8904113769531,
        247.166015625,
        357.0354309082031
      ],
      "text": "number of people placed on TPT.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        372.23663330078125,
        191.30810546875,
        388.6166076660156
      ],
      "text": "Research priorities",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        397.3675231933594,
        233.02586364746094,
        410.5125427246094
      ],
      "text": "Research priorities are as follows:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        417.1195068359375,
        78.81909942626953,
        430.2645263671875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        417.1195068359375,
        527.0160522460938,
        430.2645263671875
      ],
      "text": "specificity of Diaskintest and C-TST in populations with a low prevalence of TB infection, and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.975823402404785,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        432.6195068359375,
        332.33746337890625,
        445.7645263671875
      ],
      "text": "direct head-to-head comparisons of all three TBST;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        448.1195068359375,
        78.81920623779297,
        461.2645263671875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81920623779297,
        448.1195068359375,
        383.4869079589844,
        461.2645263671875
      ],
      "text": "assessing the barriers for implementation and patient access;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        463.6195068359375,
        78.81909942626953,
        476.7645263671875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        463.6195068359375,
        527.091064453125,
        476.7645263671875
      ],
      "text": "additional accuracy studies on high-risk groups: children aged under 5 years, children (aged",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.983137130737305,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        479.1195068359375,
        473.2572937011719,
        492.2645263671875
      ],
      "text": "5–10 years) and adolescents (aged 10–18 years), PLHIV, prisoners and migrants;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        494.6195068359375,
        78.81909942626953,
        507.7645263671875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        494.6195068359375,
        526.9807739257812,
        507.7645263671875
      ],
      "text": "studies evaluating the epidemiologic and economic impact of TBST use in the TB infection",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        510.1195068359375,
        217.04910278320312,
        523.2645263671875
      ],
      "text": "diagnosis and TPT cascade;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        525.6195068359375,
        78.81909942626953,
        538.7645263671875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        525.6195068359375,
        524.3994750976562,
        538.7645263671875
      ],
      "text": "longitudinal studies to assess the predictive value for active TB compared with current tests;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.985740661621094,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        541.1195068359375,
        78.81909942626953,
        554.2645263671875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        541.1195068359375,
        524.412353515625,
        554.2645263671875
      ],
      "text": "economic studies (e.g. cost and cost–effectiveness of TBSTs under different scenarios); and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        556.6195068359375,
        78.81909942626953,
        569.7645263671875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        556.6195068359375,
        524.4063110351562,
        569.7645263671875
      ],
      "text": "studies evaluating the use of digital tools for reading of results, to avoid return patient visits.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.976825714111328,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        589.1104125976562,
        494.7978820800781,
        611.3404541015625
      ],
      "text": "3.2. TB skin tests and interferon gamma release",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        611.910400390625,
        413.4075622558594,
        634.1404418945312
      ],
      "text": "assays for the diagnosis of TB infection",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        643.2313232421875,
        526.7941284179688,
        656.3763427734375
      ],
      "text": "Testing for TB infection increases the certainty that individuals targeted for treatment will",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        658.7313232421875,
        527.2138671875,
        671.8763427734375
      ],
      "text": "benefit from it. However, there is no gold-standard test to diagnose TB infection. Both currently",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.966197967529297,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        674.2313232421875,
        526.8848266601562,
        687.3763427734375
      ],
      "text": "available tests – the TST and IGRAs – are indirect and require a competent immune response to",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.984689712524414,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        689.7313232421875,
        526.8184204101562,
        702.8763427734375
      ],
      "text": "identify people infected with TB. A positive test result by either method is not by itself a reliable",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.977276802062988,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        705.2313232421875,
        526.9589233398438,
        718.3763427734375
      ],
      "text": "indicator of the risk of progression to active disease. This section discusses the evidence and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        720.7313232421875,
        296.3185729980469,
        733.8763427734375
      ],
      "text": "the recommendations for TB infection testing.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        347.6684875488281,
        802.0169067382812,
        556.809326171875,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "3. Recommendations for diagnosis of TB infection 139",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
